+# D and E depend on them and remain available to generation.
+Constructions:
+ Midpoint
+
+Initial configuration:
+ Triangle: A, B, C
+ D = Midpoint(A, B)
+ E = Midpoint(A, C)
+
+HiddenPoints: A, B, C
+Iterations: 1
+MaximalPoints: 1
+MaximalLines: 0
+MaximalCircles: 0
+SymmetryGenerationMode: GenerateBothSymmetricAndAsymmetric
